ia-controls="replo-:R56rb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1s3exaj"><div data-rid="3aa8c8a1-a6c0-4aab-b5dd-5d2ac0ceeee8" class="r-1yihr82 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do you ship internationally?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d8d9af87-43cf-47ad-bf4d-3a1e0758e618" class="r-xsjevf" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R56rb2:"><div data-rid="6472edec-15bc-4faa-80b8-c5ea5a63c758" class="r-bxfjk5"><div data-rid="c6e6ce2b-fdf4-42af-bc81-dd6ac3b4cb06" class="r-sh7ai6 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! We ship worldwide. International delivery times vary depending on the destination, but most orders arrive within 7–14 business days.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="af697af9-9538-4181-9951-1ee349a64e74" class="r-1hc4krc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b7c6b9f2-5cc9-4c34-9d3b-eb1becc6086c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R76rb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-grncwj"><div data-rid="c579e655-78c7-4626-b201-ad5d0486c354" class="r-48v31y alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's your return policy?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0c9a80e1-5212-4064-8d9e-5009e124d54c" class="r-11ejusr" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R76rb2:"><div data-rid="a0804071-7cac-4b23-90d6-4b5feaff4e30" class="r-2y5d4p"><div data-rid="7c1dbe9f-d196-4550-a020-99d10f4bf160" class="r-hqawg0 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>If you don't love your Monti cooler, return it within 30 days for a 50% refund — no hassle, no hard feelings.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9464ac75-1b04-4e81-9031-7429adc77fe2" class="r-9xqmu0" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ac7beb6d-c1c6-40bb-8516-e8ff5478a7a0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R96rb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-73ykah"><div data-rid="c580102d-f0ec-4aa2-bec4-d13729af68ae" class="r-39rg7s alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What if my cooler arrives damaged or defective?</p></span></div><div data-rid="63fcc045-9389-4b31-8c43-7777f06bd95e" class="r-1xq2zw9" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R96rb2:"><div data-rid="3eeb9ee3-c1bf-4f7c-a080-2fa7016b1407" class="r-qe704r"><div data-rid="2f3c95c5-ae70-4c78-b647-6560515eb63c" class="r-8wnn1i alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Reach out to our support team and we'll replace it right away. Every Monti product is covered against defects.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbb2:-trigger-6257b72a-cc56-4ead-bc68-3fd872ee25bf1" id="radix-:Rbb2:-content-6257b72a-cc56-4ead-bc68-3fd872ee25bf1" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="36dd0ca9-5142-4c8d-a65e-8d7a158ac95a" class="r-1ixs4ey"><div data-rid="834f9ea9-993a-48a5-af83-b5fc21c45715" class="r-1k0yxgd" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="dd28f0ab-3980-4b12-8589-e89dfc11ffb3" class="r-1jqnbfo" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c247e888-b206-47bf-9971-cd5c6c093abd" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3arb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-zq8rqo"><div data-rid="ee5fccab-2eff-43d6-8b0d-8bb4f0818cd0" class="r-1xxzyoz alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long does Monti keep drinks cold?</p></span></div><div data-rid="bf8c0d87-eb1f-49b6-b783-6dad1b869158" class="r-mef8f7" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3arb2:"><div data-rid="94dc9dd8-ace9-4d43-a052-3e18aa1be384" class="r-1t82i9v"><div data-rid="8871283e-bc82-420c-bbff-339c955bff89" class="r-1r42eoc alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Independent testing by Outdoor Life found Monti coolers held ice for up to 55 hours — on par with heavy-duty hard coolers, but at a fraction of the weight.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="aa91c65c-97e3-41ca-b441-ecc4752f9067" class="r-1a0i2r6" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="605009f3-9634-4019-95ae-387c9460317d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5arb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1xbp67w"><div data-rid="af0bfe40-d730-4bd8-be10-5e7b9c82c999" class="r-1nfro42 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it really leakproof?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b9eb5215-6765-410c-bd60-35e3c33ffdea" class="r-1k7iczh" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5arb2:"><div data-rid="4f756b8a-acf0-4856-937d-5f791b06c870" class="r-535gye"><div data-rid="33c6e979-b10d-41d2-a8ab-4d966de386e3" class="r-d0uip9 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Each cooler uses a seam-welded liner that prevents leaks — even when tipped on its side.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c9136715-b29f-4c44-8492-30cbc5c5e0c2" class="r-jk5tsl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="07ba41fc-0e5d-4d0e-abbf-450f572e4575" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7arb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-16zhlgi"><div data-rid="4f000222-580d-4650-abd9-af4c0238d718" class="r-11tjb02 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the material?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9f8aa99c-f20c-48c2-9033-ee7f6814dc78" class="r-emgxgu" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7arb2:"><div data-rid="c19c1797-dcfe-4f5b-ade9-bd3ad7e88c71" class="r-1ajchaa"><div data-rid="0ff85efa-b20c-4517-9e64-ed311852d2cf" class="r-95kt9y alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The shell is made of quilted, PFAS-free nylon with reinforced stitching. It's soft, durable, and stylish enough to take anywhere.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8af1e22b-d438-493f-b47c-6f4566b754eb" class="r-umq7iq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3a562fc6-8c10-4847-bbf7-f0d0697c7fed" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9arb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-3v0q4t"><div data-rid="f066ff32-e781-4f53-afbd-31f3f6f13684" class="r-4eb1xl alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Will condensation be a problem?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d72e24e8-ffae-48fb-bfbc-dfbae5c1fa66" class="r-l7qesg" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9arb2:"><div data-rid="8288fb5d-1f80-4490-91d1-02762df0fa82" class="r-5bx82j"><div data-rid="0bcb77fa-1976-410a-81b0-447cbc2e26e3" class="r-ef7jdx alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>In humid environments, we recommend ice packs instead of loose ice for best results. That way you get long chill time without excess moisture.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbb2:-trigger-98d4399c-9107-46b5-8109-b36d4f1429352" id="radix-:Rbb2:-content-98d4399c-9107-46b5-8109-b36d4f1429352" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="e09d6206-6a71-4cf5-815e-c52369c768b2" class="r-1r5u1co"><div data-rid="e9fcff01-4eb0-433d-a98c-b37a852e6d88" class="r-1991lw" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="efa90fb9-def2-4672-b55c-e661f90d2f15" class="r-6vlc8r" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3b7ac59a-7b2f-4b12-9fd4-0d55676330e5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3erb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1l6bi10"><div data-rid="470b9cca-b874-4868-aa6e-22814d9b1aed" class="r-tav5dy alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it TSA or carry-on approved?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b7cc6071-3ca7-48a9-aac6-ae022e5518ee" class="r-ptl1kr" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3erb2:"><div data-rid="a811f7e0-3087-41b4-95d4-a85eaf52fbe6" class="r-abpc0f"><div data-rid="36b0a89a-0f9a-40d4-a881-7712b346b53f" class="r-1bhszu0 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes — all Monti coolers fold into their built-in stuff sack and fit easily in carry-ons, backpacks, or totes. No oversized baggage fees here.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cf12e00c-e3fc-449b-9867-9516a05b3ca9" class="r-q3q30j" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="adfcc9a1-9498-4ed0-8756-bc31192f107e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5erb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-vvhw86"><div data-rid="352567a2-d51a-44d6-b75f-ed348626c58a" class="r-1xdnqp alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How small does it pack down?</p></span></div><div data-rid="caf539c8-e322-4f37-b79c-b1036a50034a" class="r-19tpcy6" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5erb2:"><div data-rid="401e46b3-72f5-4354-970c-757cca9a7c4a" class="r-1f183jy"><div data-rid="3f1f8b8d-8636-436a-8b13-02d302606cb6" class="r-uulqrf alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Shasta compresses into a 9" x 9" x 3.5" sack — smaller than a hoodie. The Mayfly packs down even smaller.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="335a0fab-2563-4f00-854e-694ff3feefd0" class="r-3yu181" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c0063497-67fb-4e3b-8592-43f214b476ad" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7erb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-g095jb"><div data-rid="a46e4e38-831f-41f6-bb8e-7bbbf7456f97" class="r-1ori7jm alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I fit it under an airplane seat?</p></span></div><div data-rid="18e9377d-0c3f-4676-8c3c-edd93bf72f69" class="r-peya9v" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7erb2:"><div data-rid="af51d934-0805-4e74-80f9-e65fca4cc174" class="r-1onr8or"><div data-rid="bdd136c0-06a2-4767-aec0-51356799ccf8" class="r-893f8a alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Customers regularly bring Monti coolers on flights — they fit under seats and in overhead bins when packed flat.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b198815a-c41c-4c15-80fd-d06767c972cc" class="r-9a6prf" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c233dfcd-b78e-415b-9cf9-f107ac493944" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9erb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1xm7rr9"><div data-rid="1712d601-7552-43b3-8e30-d3c5eea9e6b9" class="r-1fhe4vg alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does it add much weight to my luggage?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e48ff745-674a-4667-ba84-c1712fd7f843" class="r-1hah136" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9erb2:"><div data-rid="416d856e-ccb3-489e-9297-2a6094c3c1cb" class="r-1a1lvat"><div data-rid="cbf784c0-454b-4705-9db1-21f2ee821cb0" class="r-c7x3g7 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Not at all. The Shasta weighs only 17 oz (about as much as a water bottle).</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbb2:-trigger-7329a0f6-7e18-4db1-8be3-9481422644883" id="radix-:Rbb2:-content-7329a0f6-7e18-4db1-8be3-9481422644883" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="845ab8d4-34f9-4582-8ced-e3b9b281af83" class="r-1hruvds"><div data-rid="79d62ffb-c788-4d58-8b5b-6bdad2efc2d4" class="r-1xcxwl9" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c2aa8367-07d6-4218-a470-1e014df611bc" class="r-pxcmgl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8d0eff13-039c-43d2-ac0e-2615fe9658a2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3irb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1ie5fdf"><div data-rid="10d0e55d-2a44-4991-bd68-dce45d621af6" class="r-17uddzr alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is this good for hiking or camping?</p></span></div><div data-rid="8960cb2c-908d-48e9-bea2-5ea15cb79425" class="r-2wbyb9" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3irb2:"><div data-rid="c5017b82-cf2d-42df-85cf-573c55883534" class="r-1ligqq3"><div data-rid="df71acbe-d6dc-47aa-b9ac-0ef0145557bf" class="r-3gi2ht alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely. Lightweight design and backpack straps make it perfect for trails, day hikes, or car camping trips.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="323ba1b6-7051-4352-9387-ceaf9b815999" class="r-okewi4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="811389be-ce66-4c2e-b6d8-144160015292" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5irb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-l4078t"><div data-rid="e1b1dfae-08e5-427f-8c18-1d4ae8de2b59" class="r-1cnt4r2 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take it on a boat or to the beach?</p></span></div><div data-rid="cc97ec3d-1be4-44af-9e74-5a3420bfe58b" class="r-mm7gpc" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5irb2:"><div data-rid="d32070d0-e25a-4122-8ef9-929861460612" class="r-1h1el43"><div data-rid="d9cabace-1801-4e05-906f-0cec4ebc39dc" class="r-17hy3ky alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Monti coolers are leak-resistant, sand-friendly, and easy to rinse clean after saltwater use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cfeff2bb-2b34-4951-b447-c89f4f18b8d2" class="r-1ik8j4w" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c35f6ce7-8a00-477f-b338-7237561b551a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7irb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-oqgo7"><div data-rid="750c5f96-4d25-4e0a-b566-421d8fae95bb" class="r-1cxsxgv alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it useful for parents?</p></span></div><div data-rid="40da60be-c42a-46aa-b12c-f9c2a428f6df" class="r-1witzie" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7irb2:"><div data-rid="dee39353-8869-40f4-b399-65a2e019184a" class="r-1ot9mvm"><div data-rid="ae1979b3-c86c-4cd7-9479-46e21cb41311" class="r-1rviqrp alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many parents use Monti coolers for park days, sports practice, or road trips — it keeps snacks and drinks cold without the bulk of a hard cooler.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="154ff292-41e5-4b81-a21c-4e74ff42509d" class="r-ux9ubg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8b6d198e-6b90-4abb-b07c-0b5cf3a4c958" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9irb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-3h16z0"><div data-rid="b67bde93-c889-4d37-934f-119248b7adca" class="r-3edugo alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use it for tailgate or college events?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3424ce48-71ca-426b-a271-4b5c81883252" class="r-yw9eju" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9irb2:"><div data-rid="6c56c45b-754b-4565-86ae-413a1b8999e6" class="r-1n0qa89"><div data-rid="daf024f3-002f-4ee9-9552-869fc6b7ef37" class="r-isfp3w alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! The Shasta holds up to 23 cans and keeps them cold all game day.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2d4ddeca-9e89-4cde-b809-aa4e8aa7f6b4" class="r-16brr1b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d96f6f97-ed45-435d-9fcd-3afd565f21c0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbirb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1axsfnf"><div data-rid="b3d197c0-d139-4a28-a08d-1ede50c697c1" class="r-1hwp77p alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does it works for everyday errands?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e7d79b65-4d26-4939-acbe-b756c7570970" class="r-1c4fbjf" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbirb2:"><div data-rid="80499cdd-8cf2-40d7-8bd8-0ca24f7db227" class="r-1mzwtgx"><div data-rid="b762f7fc-bfeb-4d7d-94b6-50ec4206155a" class="r-tc605a alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Definitely. Monti coolers double as grocery bags, lunch totes, or even as an insulated carrier for wine or flowers.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rbb2:-trigger-bfb7829f-d55c-4732-8a49-a1c3dc868db74" id="radix-:Rbb2:-content-bfb7829f-d55c-4732-8a49-a1c3dc868db74" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="e913b1c6-b46f-4f42-a7e0-e19053fde381" class="r-1rb97r"><div data-rid="1a71f206-c6ef-4005-85df-72cbd2c0fed7" class="r-1vdges8" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ffa35c72-4308-4392-93f5-dda8b93f9899" class="r-1hnt4gd" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5c23c5a7-977f-4442-a0ae-439afd93b151" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3mrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1s697fa"><div data-rid="23c20823-f1e9-487c-a7d7-3ca77602fb94" class="r-mjwt4g alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the difference between Shasta and Mayfly?</p></span></div><div data-rid="444668b8-24a4-45dd-9c7f-5574b60dadc1" class="r-1pazru5" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3mrb2:"><div data-rid="bed78e89-1962-4f9c-b2f1-aea0ca535866" class="r-1avroxq"><div data-rid="ba0018f4-c08f-4418-ab1f-51791f6d1d3a" class="r-dlesis alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Shasta (23L) is our largest cooler — it holds up to 23 cans or 5 bottles of wine, perfect for group trips. The Mayfly (14L) is smaller and lighter, ideal for day trips or solo adventures.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="091ee20b-82a2-4496-8eb6-8cb1357a184e" class="r-1mwrn6r" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="bf65843e-59c2-4515-9c77-ad121ca44062" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5mrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1277zlo"><div data-rid="c2e38599-d394-4b18-a353-457bbf327953" class="r-1g78aez alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What about the Adventure Diaper Bag?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ebb93b67-770b-467f-9a26-d813bf1eb43e" class="r-1epgz9b" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5mrb2:"><div data-rid="d9cce146-1d53-4ab9-8a6e-e2dde5f7cf90" class="r-xen8ec"><div data-rid="31064810-7acf-4832-b0db-1caea534174b" class="r-1up6bnb alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Adventure Bag is designed for parents on the go. It includes an insulated bottle pouch, smart storage, and stroller hooks — combining Monti's cooling tech with parenting convenience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6d4b32bd-da1a-4c8c-ae84-6f024a20380c" class="r-1r3yejg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5f1bae58-4741-4248-a55e-00435d814cfa" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7mrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-pxp566"><div data-rid="78f5875f-4015-405b-8869-0846ac76dd93" class="r-ldzlu7 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How much does each cooler weigh?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b605dd57-2dba-4068-817f-06500dd97661" class="r-2eb8w5" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7mrb2:"><div data-rid="4a52bf9c-d1af-4673-b9f8-93124151043f" class="r-1buciyc"><div data-rid="589ba6d6-8f9f-4cf7-bb4f-f3923e5bd5e4" class="r-lwlqov alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Shasta: 17.2 oz. Mayfly: 14.7 oz. Both are lighter than most water bottles.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="97836bb9-ade8-408e-898f-d7d9d86c857d" class="r-qyz4s7" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c8ff55c6-c1ae-42ad-9e71-c827149b288e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9mrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1bb0c3c"><div data-rid="ddf401f8-a19f-4265-aed3-7e548de12da9" class="r-1gf99jy alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I pick the right size?</p></span></div><div data-rid="59c1b019-8b8d-4676-8229-0990602b59c6" class="r-ylkpgp" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9mrb2:"><div data-rid="bb7848ae-2c1a-478f-acd8-eaa8dd6c98f1" class="r-1mw995f"><div data-rid="47061e36-84d2-441b-a294-b20f9d5aa88f" class="r-c9kdwt alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>If you're traveling with family or groups, go with the Shasta. For solo adventures or carry-on minimalism, the Mayfly is perfect. Parents who want versatility should check out the Adventure Bag.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7a2c2bca-e6f2-4534-81af-95a7e8801dd8" class="r-1ouvuo5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6fd1ac9e-ab05-4120-b5fd-e8a974ac39fc" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbmrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-33ha84"><div data-rid="b779ad7d-d51b-46f4-bb9e-c4a4a268b53b" class="r-1hc35kv alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I own more than one?</p></span></div><div data-rid="1a84ed8b-cac3-478e-b04e-410b4f95a7ec" class="r-1y4yo4g" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbmrb2:"><div data-rid="264d4519-ba46-4f9f-aa54-eab616327a47" class="r-jc14wy"><div data-rid="65165ddf-b674-4bca-b002-6e04080fed53" class="r-17a9jo8 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-8aa12dcb-9abd-4aa6-92f0-cbabdac120c1-styles-7baa333b-986b-42ce-b32a-9448b840ad6d-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many customers do! Shasta for bigger trips, Mayfly for everyday runs, Adventure Bag for family needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ovo:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Work+Sans:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Mulish:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
